+	bool "Android reserved-group network capabilities"
+	depends on ANDROID && NET
+	default n
+	help
+	  Permit the reserved Android net_raw (3004) and net_admin (3005)
+	  groups to satisfy CAP_NET_RAW and CAP_NET_ADMIN checks, including
+	  the legacy netlink receive capability path.  This supports Android
+	  Wi-Fi daemons launched as non-root without ambient capabilities.
+
+	  Grants apply only to credentials in the initial user namespace,
+	  respect capability bounding-set drops, and do not bypass SELinux.
+	  This does not enable Android's separate INET socket group gate.
+	  Leave disabled for non-Android kernels or when this ABI is unused.
+
